---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
export const prerender=true;
---
<Layout title="Collection & delivery"><section class="page-head"><div class="wrap"><div class="breadcrumbs"><a href="/">Home</a><span>/</span><span>Collection & delivery</span></div><p class="eyebrow">Collection & delivery</p><h1>Plan the last part of the journey.</h1></div></section><div class="wrap"><article class="prose"><h2>Collection</h2><p>Your quote will confirm the collection location, any applicable charges and the arrangements for collecting your trailer. Please confirm these details before travelling.</p><h2>Delivery</h2><p>Tell us your postcode and delivery requirements when you enquire. Freight is quoted separately when it is not already confirmed. An unconfirmed freight charge is never treated as free delivery.</p><h2>Before you collect</h2><p>Confirm the trailer specification and its compatibility with your towing vehicle, coupling and electrical connection. Any registration and handover requirements should be agreed before collection.</p><a class="button" href="/quote/">Send an enquiry ↗</a></article></div></Layout>
